message: "If you use IMM-Core, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "IMM-Core: Interview Metadata Model — Core Profile"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-02"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.20507329"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >
  A generic, openly published minimal metadata model for interview-based
  qualitative research. Discipline-agnostic two-layer architecture: Core Profile
  (generic) plus Implementation Profiles (specialisations). LuxOH-CMDI is the
  first registered Implementation Profile.
